<InfoLayout title="Legacy resource status" description="Rights and availability notes for verified resources formerly associated with this domain." canonicalPath="/download/" kicker="Legacy status · noindex" lede="A human-readable status page, not a destination built to absorb the old download backlink cluster." noindex={true}>
  <h2 style="margin-top:0">No first-party legacy download is offered</h2>
  <p>The domain purchase did not transfer copyright, source files or a licence to redistribute the former operator’s work. A broken historic link is not replaced with a guessed file, an unrelated current offer or an unverified archive copy.</p>

  <h2>Why this page is noindex</h2>
  <p>The current backlink profile for this address is dominated by unrelated automated and compromised-site spam. Keeping a transparent status page helps a person following a genuine old reference, but the page is excluded from the sitemap and is not used to pass that link volume into the current Strings Lab.</p>

  <h2>Verified project records</h2>
  <dl class="facts">
    <div><dt>The Spy Guitar</dt><dd>Former sampled-instrument project. Read <a href="/legacy/the-spy-guitar/">the neutral archive record</a>; no original file is redistributed.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Bang My Twister</dt><dd>Former Max for Live/controller project. A related mapping remains listed at <a href="https://maps.djtechtools.com/mappings/2929" rel="noopener external">DJ TechTools</a>; this site does not mirror it.</dd></div>
  </dl>

  <h2>Current work starts elsewhere</h2>
  <p>Die heutigen Werkzeuge und Leitfäden sind neue Arbeiten. Starte mit dem <a href="/tools/eventmusik-planer/">Eventmusik-Planer</a>, dem <a href="/viola/">Viola-Hub</a> oder den <a href="/recording/">Aufnahmeleitfäden</a>. Sie werden nicht als Ersatz für frühere Downloads dargestellt.</p>

  <h2>Rights or provenance information</h2>
  <p>If you created a former resource or hold relevant rights, send the historic title, source URL and evidence of your relationship to <a href="mailto:info@matthiasramahi.de?subject=Auspicious%20Music%20archive">info@matthiasramahi.de</a>. Do not attach binaries in the first message.</p>
</InfoLayout>
